WEBVTT

00:34:29.295 --> 00:34:31.004
DF: Yeah, I totally agree with you,

00:34:31.028 --> 00:34:32.829
and I think it's a complicated topic,

00:34:32.853 --> 00:34:38.425
but you see it in, like,
the business discourse

00:34:38.449 --> 00:34:41.293
of, "We've got to win,
we're going to win."

00:34:41.317 --> 00:34:43.598
And you even see recommendations

00:34:43.622 --> 00:34:45.163
that I also always bristled at,

00:34:45.187 --> 00:34:48.999
it's like, we need to identify
an enemy, or an opponent.

00:34:49.023 --> 00:34:51.230
People will rally around that.

00:34:51.254 --> 00:34:52.435
But I agree with you,

00:34:52.459 --> 00:34:54.579
I much more subscribe to the idea of,

00:34:54.603 --> 00:34:56.634
don't worry about who the competitors are,

00:34:56.658 --> 00:35:00.549
get customer-obsessed and just focus
on solving for the customer.